currencies:
  - { code: USD, monthly: 59 }
  - { code: CAD, monthly: 79 }
  - { code: AUD, monthly: 89 }
  - { code: EUR, monthly: 59 }
  - { code: GBP, monthly: 49 }
  - { code: NZD, monthly: 99 }
  - { code: SGD, monthly: 79 }
features:
  - icon: fa-calculator
    title: Full-Featured Accounting
    description: The complete Manager feature set — invoicing, bank reconciliation, reports and more.
  - icon: fa-bolt
    title: Nothing to Install
    description: Easy to set up. Your books run in the browser at your own address.
  - icon: fa-mobile-screen
    title: Any Device
    description: Use on desktops, laptops, tablets and phones — anywhere with remote access.
  - icon: fa-users
    title: Multi-User Access
    description: Your whole team works in the same books at the same time, with user permissions to control who sees what.
  - icon: fa-database
    title: Automatic Backups
    description: Your data is backed up automatically — nothing for you to manage.
  - icon: fa-rotate
    title: Automatic Updates
    description: Always on the latest version without lifting a finger.
faqs:
  - q: Do we pay extra for more users or businesses?
    a: No. We don't charge you based on how many users or businesses you add. 5 or 50, the price is the same. If you have many businesses, you can also specify which businesses are visible to which users. Great for accountants with many clients.
  - q: Do you offer discounts?
    a: We strive to price our services fairly and transparently for all our customers, which is why we do not offer discounts. Our goal is to deliver exceptional value that exceeds the cost, even at full price. One flat price covers unlimited users and unlimited businesses, so what you see is what everyone pays.
  - q: Can we cancel subscription at any time?
    a: You can cancel at any time without penalty or hassle. And unlike most online accounting systems which lock you in, your data is always yours — you can download all of it from the cloud whenever you want.
  - q: How do I manage my subscription?
